rectangle "MORE THAN ENOUGH\n<size:16>[Software System]</size>" <<Boundary-TU9SRSBUSEFOIEVOT1VHSA==>> {
  rectangle "Simulation Core\n<size:16>[Container: JavaScript (ES5, browser + Node)]</size>" <<Boundary-U2ltdWxhdGlvbiBDb3Jl>> {
    rectangle "==World Generation (infinite)\n<size:16>[Component: JavaScript]</size>\n\nEndless, chunked world: terrain is a pure function of (x, y, seed) via valueNoise/fbm octaves, streamed in lazily in 16x16 chunks and LRU-cached, so there are no bounds, edges or wrapping. Tile types (T) and resource richness (rich/max, uniformly random with no distance ramp) are generated per chunk; sparse per-tile edits (mods) and per-chunk fog bitmasks (explored) live outside the cache so they persist. FindSpawn picks a random walkable birth tile near (0,0); nothing is sculpted." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsQ29yZSBFbmdpbmU=>> as MORETHANENOUGH.SimulationCore.WorldGenerationinfinite
    rectangle "==State and Saves\n<size:16>[Component: JavaScript]</size>\n\ncreateState() builds the canonical state object; serialize/deserialize convert it to a JSON save (format v3: sparse richness deltas + per-chunk fog bitmasks; older v1/v2 saves are intentionally discarded and the world starts fresh). state.events is transient and NEVER serialized." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsQ29yZSBFbmdpbmU=>> as MORETHANENOUGH.SimulationCore.StateandSaves
    rectangle "==Simulation Step\n<size:16>[Component: JavaScript]</size>\n\nstep(s, dt) - the heart of the tick: extractor production into buffers, range-limited logistics auto-collect, abundance trickle, world regrowth (REGROW_INTERVAL 0.5s, only tiles near the player), time + stats. Called once per frame by the app and by every test." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsQ29yZSBFbmdpbmU=>> as MORETHANENOUGH.SimulationCore.SimulationStep
    rectangle "==Gathering and Collection\n<size:16>[Component: JavaScript]</size>\n\nManual actions: gather() from a tile within GATHER_RANGE (1.65) using axe/pickaxe multipliers; collect() drains extractor buffers within COLLECT_RANGE (1.7). gatherTarget/collectTarget report what is actionable for the UI." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsQ29yZSBFbmdpbmU=>> as MORETHANENOUGH.SimulationCore.GatheringandCollection
    rectangle "==Extractors and Building\n<size:16>[Component: JavaScript]</size>\n\nplace()/buildTarget()/occupied(); EXTRACTORS catalog (rates, buffer caps, base costs, required deposit tile or any-land blueprint-gated converters); extractor cost scaling; blueprint unlocks gate foundry/brickyard/sapling/observatory." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsQ29yZSBFbmdpbmU=>> as MORETHANENOUGH.SimulationCore.ExtractorsandBuilding
    rectangle "==Logistics and Auto-Collect\n<size:16>[Component: JavaScript]</size>\n\nWhen unlocked, step() drains whole units from any extractor within AUTO_COLLECT_RANGE (3.0 tiles) of the player and pushes a transient {res, amt, x, y} event so the UI can animate the flow. Walking away stops collection: buffers just fill and cap until you return." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsQ29yZSBFbmdpbmU=>> as MORETHANENOUGH.SimulationCore.LogisticsandAutoCollect
    rectangle "==Tools, Upgrades and Unlocks\n<size:16>[Component: JavaScript]</size>\n\nTOOLS level table (axe/pickaxe/boots/overclock), UNLOCKS (logistics, blueprints, abundance engine), buyUpgrade/upgradeInfo, canAfford/pay/costText. overclockMult multiplies ALL extractor production." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsQ29yZSBFbmdpbmU=>> as MORETHANENOUGH.SimulationCore.ToolsUpgradesandUnlocks
    rectangle "==Refineries and Abundance\n<size:16>[Component: JavaScript]</size>\n\nPer-resource chains (RES_UPGRADES: Silviculture/Masonry/Metallurgy/Crystallurgy), repeatable Abundance Engine levels + trickle, EXTRACTOR_GROWTH 1.65; resProdMult folds overclock + refinery + abundance + legacy multipliers together." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsQ29yZSBFbmdpbmU=>> as MORETHANENOUGH.SimulationCore.RefineriesandAbundance
    rectangle "==Prestige and Perks\n<size:16>[Component: JavaScript]</size>\n\nEmbark resets the world and banks Insight (gated by EMBARK_MIN_TOTAL 20000 lifetime resources); perks legacy/nomad/memory/heirloom/cartographer; legacyMult (x1.25/level) and nomadMult scale production and movement." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsQ29yZSBFbmdpbmU=>> as MORETHANENOUGH.SimulationCore.PrestigeandPerks
    rectangle "==Goals, Stats and Clock\n<size:16>[Component: JavaScript]</size>\n\nGOALS list + goalIndex progression; stats counters (wood/stone/ore/crystal/gathers/collected/playedMs); the day/night clock (pure daylight() over DAY_LENGTH 240s); exploration radius (EXPLORE_RADIUS 6) and movement physics (BASE_SPEED 3.7, move, canStand, onWater, boots speed)." <<Element-RWxlbWVudCxDb21wb25lbnQsQ29yZSBFbmdpbmU=>> as MORETHANENOUGH.SimulationCore.GoalsStatsandClock
